{"unit_id":"sijie-ni-0214__dsh-subagent-error-details#card-zh","repo":"sijie-ni-0214/dsh-subagent-error-details","commit":"267d2b1cae9a3898343eeafe9b0be321fa343d2b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-error-details 是一个面向 DSH 各 agent preset 的后台子 agent 错误详情插件。它通过 bundle 注册为 host-plane 插件，监听子 agent 结束事件，并从子会话的 turn/end 记录中提取错误码和消息，再将补充通知路由给对应父 agent。父 agent 空闲时使用 followup，运行中则使用 steer；如果核心通知已经包含错误详情，插件会抑制重复消息。解析过程包含有限重试，服务缺失或会话没有错误记录时会跳过投递。适合需要辨认后台委派任务失败原因的 DSH 用户。安装后需重启 DSH 激活。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-10","src/index.ts:167-250","src/extract.ts:20-35"]}
{"unit_id":"sijie-ni-0214__dsh-subagent-error-details#card-en","repo":"sijie-ni-0214/dsh-subagent-error-details","commit":"267d2b1cae9a3898343eeafe9b0be321fa343d2b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-error-details adds failure details to DSH subagent notices. It reads error codes and messages from the child session's turn/end event and sends a companion notice to the parent, using followup when idle and steer while running. It skips duplicates when core already includes details.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-10","src/index.ts:167-250","src/extract.ts:20-35"]}
